s/b73c4640-b12e-48ba-8de9-6b05e97d66d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=43913c5a55b8d2beebb2bfb2d2b75c78, https://si.imgix.net/22d851ce/uploads/origins/b73c4640-b12e-48ba-8de9-6b05e97d66d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f8d74382fcbdf51be2762e1f728f74b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/22d851ce/uploads/origins/b73c4640-b12e-48ba-8de9-6b05e97d66d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa45083b0a9b49dbb91da7f76186fb76 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/22d851ce/uploads/origins/b73c4640-b12e-48ba-8de9-6b05e97d66d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=de0b11f7642cf59fc7f884776adcbe19", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/22d851ce/uploads/origins/b73c4640-b12e-48ba-8de9-6b05e97d66d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=de0b11f7642cf59fc7f884776adcbe19, https://si.imgix.net/22d851ce/uploads/origins/b73c4640-b12e-48ba-8de9-6b05e97d66d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=95ee8ce04976424c0a16992133c44237 2x, https://si.imgix.net/22d851ce/uploads/origins/b73c4640-b12e-48ba-8de9-6b05e97d66d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=54731b3e5dd0ddce725ff3242b6d0439 3x"}, "body": "Name:Miyazaki Kotori \nAge:17 \nHeight:149cm \nPose:Crouching down, playing with a cat  \nSetting: playground in the morning by the flowerbeds and benches.   \n\nAppearance: Kotori is cute, petite girl with short red hair, almost reaching her shoulders and blue eyes. The underside of her hair is black as well as the tips. She also has an orangish/red glint toward the bottom of her eyes. Kotori has thin eye brows and long eyelashes. Kotori has slender fingers and her nails are painted in a red and black flower pattern. Kotori also has a small nose and small ears. She has a very infectious smile and a cute fang on the right side. Kotori wears the same school uniform as Yurika except she wears a yellow criss-cross tie and black thigh high stockings. She also wears her vest tied around her waist. She wears two black hair clips on the left side of her hair and a yellow bow clip on the right side. She wears a black choker necklace, gold huggie earrings, and a 4 different types of bracelts, 2 on each hand. She also wears a gold ring on her right pointer finger and one on her left pinky. Kotori has a cute round face and typically wears light blush and pink lip stick and eye liner. Despite her small stature Kotori’s physical attributes are comparable to Yurika’s. Her chest is only a couple sizes smaller and even though she doesn’t exercise very often she has nice thighs and a thin waist. \n(Reference:URL for hairstyle, chest size, eye color, and the bow tie)  \n\nPersonality: Kotori is a very outgoing and energetic girl , similar to Kyoko. She naturally is able to get along with everyone and is very expressive. Kotori’s also very smart despite her Gal-esc appearance. She’s the type of girl that often puts herself down and is afraid of what other people think about her. She puts on a smile even if she’s really hurting. She’s a very stoic person despite her frail heart. After she became friends with Yurika, she started to love herself and became much more expressive overall.\n\nhttps://danbooru.donmai.us/posts/5629042", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sushida0k/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1332417, "client_id": 2296351, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d673b73f/uploads/origins/06152609-05df-410f-89e4-54b54fbfb43d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=32e286dd1216b8b